<p>A new inquiry was submitted through the website contact form.</p>
<table cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse:collapse">
  <tr><td style="font-weight:bold">Name</td><td>{{fullName}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="font-weight:bold">Email</td><td><a href="mailto:{{email}}">{{email}}</a></td></tr>
  <tr><td style="font-weight:bold">Phone</td><td>{{phone}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="font-weight:bold">Submitted</td><td>{{submittedAt}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="font-weight:bold;margin-top:16px">Message</p>
<p style="white-space:pre-wrap">{{message}}</p>
<hr>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:12px">Reply directly to {{email}} to respond to this inquiry.</p>
